[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1202.39, "timestamp": "00:20:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1204.95, "timestamp": "00:20:04", "text": "我相信这是我们第一次合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1208.48, "timestamp": "00:20:08", "text": "像这样就对吧？嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1237.75, "timestamp": "00:20:37", "text": "所以，我们必须把洗衣区设在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1239.43, "timestamp": "00:20:39", "text": "这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1241.75, "timestamp": "00:20:41", "text": "因为这样更容易收拾餐具"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1246.31, "timestamp": "00:20:46", "text": "在这里洗漱。因为如果你进去之后，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1250.07, "timestamp": "00:20:50", "text": "真是烦人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1252.549, "timestamp": "00:20:52", "text": "所以就像是，哦，做饭，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1254.39, "timestamp": "00:20:54", "text": "放在这里，然后把盘子放上去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1258.71, "timestamp": "00:20:58", "text": "然后巴拉巴拉巴拉。太疯狂了。"}]